      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WATCH PARTY (2) goes very well this course and distance starting six times for three wins and two minors. Hit the frame latest (22.05) when third at this track in a Grade 5. Expected to go close. FEDERAL JOKER (1) jumped from this same draw and was close to the lead throughout before boxing on well and holding a 4.5 lengths third (30.98) at Q Parklands over 520m in a P5. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. SPRING MARINER (8) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (19.83) at this track behind Best Yet in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Bold showing expected. TORPEY HAYZE (7) is not to be discarded.",
